  "item_short_desc": "<p>Comfort and classic style take hold with Rothco's 5-Button Sweater. This sweater is crafted from a soft and comfortable acrylic material, ensuring warmth and durability. Modeled after vintage fatigue sweaters, it features 5 large buttons on the upper half, adding a touch of vintage-inspired style. The elastic knit cuffs and waistband provide a snug fit, keeping the cold out and warmth in.</p>",
